0 FILE 10212 - main.ldr
0 LEGO UCS Imperial Shuttle (10212) main assembly: central white Technic spine of bent liftarms, beams, axles, pins and gears that carries the plated fuselage, folding wing sub-assemblies, glazed cockpit canopy, sloped tail fin, engine and sensor nacelles, the black display base and crew minifigs (Darth Vader, Luke Skywalker, a Stormtrooper, an Imperial Officer and an Imperial Pilot)
0 Name: 10212 - main.ldr
0 Author: Roland Dahl [RolandD]
